                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.60H31/182: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Yugoslavia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lane</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-09-21T14:00:00-04:00">September 21, 1939—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>45. Your 276, September 18, 6 p.m. Under the circumstances you may defer
                    initiating discussions proposed in Department’s instruction.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
